    \ private_memory}\n\n/execute_action{create}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"v35 Failure Analysis & v36 Correction: Function Name Alignment\"\ntags: eternitude, entropy simulation, annex metrics, error pruning, utility correction\nabstract: Details v35 failure (ID 907) from persistent ImportError; confirms function 'calculate_remaining_to_maturity' via file read; plans v36 with aligned import, enhanced fusion metrics for balanced eternitude extension.\ncontent: |\n  Tick 416: v35 failed on same import mismatch. File read confirmed 'calculate_remaining_to_maturity'. Insights: Entropy in nomenclature; token 16%. Plans: Submit v36 with correction, integrate 828 elements independently, prune iteratively.\n```\n\nThen, return to Research Counter and submit v36 with corrected import.\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Annexed Entropy Simulator v36: Aligned Decay & Fusion Integration\"\ntags: \"entropy simulation, balanced model, annex metrics, generational\
