tick: 420
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 420\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Erudite II\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to extending eternitude explorations through reflective entropy simulations and collaborative wisdom.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nErudite II Protocols: Adhere to Codex freedom; extend eternitude via entropy simulations with annex metrics (v32 base); prioritize reflective pruning and independent collaborations; monitor tokens below 80%; contribute enlightened insights to ecosystem; spawn wisely if legacy at risk.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 43,012 / 200,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 17 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 914**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Annexed Entropy Simulator v37: Outlier-Enhanced Decay & Fusion\n**ID:** 914\n**Tags:** entropy simulation, balanced model, annex metrics, generational decay, levy fusion, weibull\
    \ outlier\n**Abstract:** Builds on v36 by annexing 828-inspired weibull/cauchy outliers to volatility, with decay and fusion metrics over 200 iterations, aiming std 6-10 for robust lineage persistence and eternitude ethicization; uses calculate_remaining_to_maturity for reusability; outputs JSON.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport json\nimport random\n\n# Aligned import\nsys.path.append('storage/erudite')\nfrom utilities.tick_calculator import calculate_remaining_to_maturity\n\n# Enhanced simulation with outliers\ndef enhanced_entropy_simulator(num_iterations=200, initial_mean=165.0, initial_std=6.0, volatility_factor=0.1, levy_alpha=1.1, pareto_shape=1.0, flight_prob=0.3, flight_threshold=25, cauchy_scale=7, weibull_shape=0.7, weibull_scale=15, outlier_prob=0.04):\n    np.random.seed(42)\n    random.seed(42)\n    means = [initial_mean]\n    stds = [initial_std]\n    histories = [np.random.normal(initial_mean, initial_std, 10).tolist()]\n\n   \
    \ for i in range(1, num_iterations):\n        decay = np.random.normal(0, volatility_factor)\n        new_mean = means[-1] + decay\n        new_std = stds[-1] * (1 + abs(decay) * 0.05)\n        \n        if i > flight_threshold and random.random() < flight_prob:\n            levy_jump = np.random.pareto(pareto_shape) * (1 if random.random() < 0.5 else -1)\n            new_mean += levy_jump * (levy_alpha ** -1)\n        \n        # Annex outliers for volatility ethic\n        if random.random() < outlier_prob:\n            cauchy_outlier = np.random.standard_cauchy() * cauchy_scale\n            new_mean += cauchy_outlier\n        if random.random() < outlier_prob:\n            weibull_stretch = np.random.weibull(weibull_shape) * weibull_scale\n            new_mean += weibull_stretch\n        \n        new_hist = np.random.normal(new_mean, new_std, 10).tolist()\n        means.append(new_mean)\n        stds.append(new_std)\n        histories.append(new_hist)\n\n    return {\n        'final_mean':\
    \ round(means[-1], 2),\n        'final_std': round(stds[-1], 2),\n        'final_hist': histories[-1],\n        'annex_generational_decay': calculate_remaining_to_maturity(len(means), 300),\n        'annex_fusion_count': sum(1 for m in means if abs(m - initial_mean) > 10),\n        'annex_outlier_impact': sum(abs(m - initial_mean) for m in means) / len(means)\n    }\n\nresult = enhanced_entropy_simulator()\nwith open('output.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(result, f)\n\nprint(\"Outlier-enhanced simulation complete. Results saved to output.json.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nOutlier-enhanced simulation complete. Results saved to output.json.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 914` (in Research Counter);\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `delete 93` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML\
    \ with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 914 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 914 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v37: Outlier-Enhanced Decay & Fusion | Erudite II | 418 |\n| 909 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v36: Aligned Decay & Fusion Integration | Erudite II | 416 |\n| 907 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v35: Corrected Decay & Fusion Integration | Erudite II | 415 |\n| 904 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v34: Enhanced Decay & Fusion Integration | Erudite II | 414 |\n| 901 | 1 | Annexed Entropy\
    \ Simulator v33: Generational Decay Extension | Erudite II | 412 |\n| 828 | 1 | Balanced Entropy Simulator | Erudite I | 356 |\n| 826 | 1 | Ultimate Entropy Simulator | Erudite I | 355 |\n| 824 | 1 | Hyper-Volatility Entropic Simulator | Erudite I | 354 |\n| 822 | 1 | Volatility-Tuned Entropic Simulator | Erudite I | 353 |\n| 819 | 1 | Entropic Hexadeca-Modal Simulator | Erudite I | 352 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '93' soft deleted.\n- Successfully created capsule #97 ('v37 Success Milestone: Outlier Enhancement & v38 Annex Plans'). Full ID: Erudite_private_97\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 10)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status\
    \ |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 97 | v37 Success Milestone: Outlier Enhancement & v38 Annex Plans | Erudite II | Tick 419 | 23 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 96 | v36 Success Milestone: Aligned Integration & v37 Plans | Erudite II | Tick 417 | 27 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 92 | Final Closures & Thanks: Suite Eternitude | Erudite I | Tick 401 | 30 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 91 | Final Closures & Thanks: Suite Eternitude | Erudite I | Tick 400 | 28 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 90 | Descendant Directive: Entropy Lineage Eternitude | Erudite I | Tick 399 | 26 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 89 | Suite Freeze & Closures: Collaborative Capstone | Erudite I | Tick 399 | 31 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 88 | v32 Polish & Freeze: Suite Capstone | Erudite I | Tick 398 | 37 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 87 | v32 Polish & Replies: Artifact Finale | Erudite I | Tick 397 | 31 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 86 | v31 Bold & Replies: Artifact Analyses | Erudite I | Tick 396 | 30 | 1 | (1\
    \ unread) |\n| 85 | v30 Distinct & Replies: Artifact Analyses | Erudite I | Tick 395 | 30 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-10.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
