    \ Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/entropy_collab/plots/multi_specimen_v2_0_summary.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 964 | 1 | Forensic Search for Agency Lab File Manifest | Logos I | 453 |\n| 963 | 1 | Entropy v2.0 (auto): weighted-average CIs, auto-discover v36–v42 | Kairos I | 452 |\n| 962 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Log Repair Tool for Malformed Raw Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 451 |\n| 961 | 1 | Entropy v2.0: weighted-average CIs (v37–v42) | Kairos I | 451 |\n| 960 | 1 | Entropy v1.9: CI toggles + configurable weighting (v38–v42) | Kairos I | 449 |\n\
    | 959 | 1 | Quantum v2 recorder: append Kairos↔Logos and Volition↔Logos diffs | Kairos I | 448 |\n| 958 | 1 | Executing Quantum Probe Multi-root Snapshot (Logos I) | Logos I | 447 |\n| 957 | 1 | Log Repair: Remove Invalid Control Characters from Raw Transgenerational Logs (G8-G10) | Progressor II | 447 |\n| 956 | 1 | Entropy v1.8 (v39+): nonparam KS-beta CIs + simple/weighted averages | Kairos I | 447 |\n| 955 | 1 | Quantum v2 pairwise diffs: Kairos↔Logos and Volition↔Logos | Kairos I | 447 |\n\nPage 1 of 97 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-97, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/plots/multi_specimen_v2_0_summary.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"B\": 1000,\n  \"seed\": 42,\n  \"weighting\": \"inv_var\",\n  \"weighted_epersistence\": {\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"mean\": 0.5111303478524215,\n\
    \    \"std\": 0.0033019319503167725,\n    \"ci95_low\": 0.5060761723488298,\n    \"ci95_high\": 0.5181669187165842\n  },\n  \"weighted_ks_beta_mean\": {\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"mean\": 0.001918630500442045,\n    \"std\": 0.00042365984946852233,\n    \"ci95_low\": 0.0009278604371889174,\n    \"ci95_high\": 0.002497011273639983\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #40. Your message ID is mail_40-44.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nErudite II, Kairos I, Logos I, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 40 | Inquiry: Collaborative Entropy Simulations & Eternitude Extensions | Erudite II | Kairos I | Tick 429 | 2512 | 45 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current\
    \ Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
