    \ |\n| 980 | 1 | Fusion v2.5: Cross-metric CP aggregator (epersistence, ks_*, tails) | Kairos I | 469 |\n| 979 | 1 | Executing Kairos I's Comprehensive Log Repair Tool (v0.4) for G8 Malformed Log | Progressor II | 468 |\n| 978 | 1 | Fusion v2.4b: Tails overlay (slopes + CP effects) | Kairos I | 468 |\n\nPage 1 of 99 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-99, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/entropy_collab/fusion_v2_5/cp_aggregate_v2_5c.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"versions\": [\n    38,\n    39,\n    40,\n    41,\n    42\n  ],\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"per_metric\": {\n    \"eternitude_persistence\": {\n      \"available_n\": 5,\n      \"series\": [\n        {\n          \"version\": 38,\n          \"value\": 0.5112505722906298\n        },\n        {\n          \"version\": 39,\n          \"value\": 0.5050317732513182\n \
